# 61. Important Security Notes

Never expose sensitive authentication information.

Avoid sharing:

```text
/etc/shadow
Password hashes
Private keys
Authentication tokens
Real passwords
```

When practicing Linux user management, use a:

```text
Virtual Machine
```

or another isolated lab environment.

Do not experiment with user deletion or account modification on a production system unless you are authorized and understand the consequences.

